# cmd/sort.c AND NOT cmd/sort/.  Both are on the tape and they are different
# programs: the directory is the portable POSIX release -- its README opens
# "Posix P1003.2-compatible sort utility from Unix research v10 system" and
# its Makefile probes for memmove and strtoul -- while Admin/large:23 names
# `sort.c', so the single file is the one this machine's own build system
# compiles, and it compiles it -O.
